716 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Overall Performance The campaign ran 7 ads targeting the Kochi market\054 spending a total of \27133\054713\05603 across 4\054734\054611 impressions\054 reaching 1\054089\054850 accounts with an average CPM of \2717\05612 and an overall CTR of 0\05612\045\056\n\nCampaign Breakdown by Objective\nAwareness\nMar\13714\137Awareness\137Kochi\137Ad delivered the widest reach \055 809\054036 people at a very efficient \2713\05610 CPM\054 spending \2714\054505\05626\056 CTR was low at 0\05606\045\054 which is expected for awareness\055only objectives\056\n\nProfile Visits\nMar\13727\137PV\137Kochi\137Ad drove 684 Instagram profile visits at \2711\05677 per visit\054 a reasonably efficient result\054 with a notably higher CTR of 0\05670\045\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 717 0 R
